segment.source:
But, but, but, errr, does it work? Check this trigger, check! ::He almost pulls the trigger without making sure the chamber is empty, but reason caught up with him and he ejects the magazine and pulls the charging handle.::

::Then he pulls the trigger.:: Click! ::Click.:: You hear?

::Click.:: Hey, no slack anymore. ::Click.:: Ehehe. And the handle, it pulls smooth, like butt of bebechka.&lt;end&gt;

